o/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise to Legend. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the board, every move matters. Defend your Glass, break your opponent’s, and seize map control through smart positioning and bold plays. Matches are short and intense but mastery runs deep. Unlock new Champions through battle-earned experience and shift your strategy with each win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>And May the Glass Break Your Way.</strong><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fair-to-Play, only cosmetics cost $ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Build a squad from a unique roster of 12 Champions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Master real-time, hex-based tactile battles across 4 arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock new Champions, rewards and +400 cosmetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rise up in ranked 1v1, 2v2, 1v2 or AI Skirmish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Quick, 10 minute matches and earn XP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cross-platform Play!</p>", "short_description": "Lead your squad of Champions into a fast-paced and tactile competitive arena where tactics, magic, and power collide. Master the battlefield in this real-time clash of Champions!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/05066115e40765339b119857d296dcc7260a7ee4/header.jpg?t=1770418120", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/887330/58d7466de2d481916a689f7e8418e2c4f8c5b2a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770418120", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/8873